{"availability":"available","full":"HKJPN/markdown-editor","name":"markdown-editor","description":"MD//WORKS — a browser-native Markdown editor built for real work. Security first, no cloud lock-in, no learning curve. It supports live preview, English spell check (Hunspell), and importing docx file. It feels like a native app and treats AI as a co-writer, not a gimmick.","category":"Education","language":"HTML","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-04-20T09:08:31Z","updated":"2026-10-06T12:04:55Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"","topics":[],"demo":"https://hkjpn.github.io/markdown-editor/**","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:52.353Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:52.353Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T05:46:52.353Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T22:14:06.822Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-04T21:35:14.071Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-06T22:53:56.732Z","stars":9,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T05:46:52.353Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["100% Local, yet AI-Ready: MD//WORKS is entirely local and cloud-free. Keep your data fully secure on your device, while still leveraging your browser's native AI sidebars for seamless assistance without copy-pasting. Of course, it also offers full support for local LLMs.","Deep Edit Mode - Your editing, remembered: Not just what you wrote, but what you deleted. Batches typing every 5 seconds, tracks large deletions, pastes, replace-all, and formatting with heading context. 500 events max, memory-only, never sent, Base64 omitted. The DEEP badge glows quietly while it listens. You can also leverage AI to analyze your editing process from an objective, third-person perspective (Planned for v1.6.1 or later). For more information about AI integration, see \"11. AI-Assisted Writing\" in the manual.","Choose a theme based on your working environment: Midnight for focused editing, Paper for reviewing, and Warm for lon